correct_plate = "VOM-7998"
incident = "Park Drive"
details = "The morning of the 27th, someone sped into town from the north, drove straight across the park in town, and then took off down the South-East highway.  They messed up the grass in front of the capitol and nearly hit the bar owner while she was taking out the trash.  Maybe they couldn't see in all the rain that day?  No...that's no excuse for breaking the law!"
